    <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The LocalSubComponent class is a subclass of Feature. This class serves as a way to create a placeholder in more complex Components, such as a variable to be filled in later or a composite that exists only within the context of the parent Component.</rdfs:comment>
    <otol:domainEntity rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">true</otol:domainEntity>
  </rdf:Description>
