    <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Controlled vocabulary for the roles that a Protein Component can play in a design. The value of a Component's role property must be an instance of a class that is a subclass of ProteinRole.</rdfs:comment>
