    <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A wrapper for the PROV-O Agent class. The purpose of this class is to allow for the inclusion of SBOL-specific properties on PROV Agents, such as the association of an Agent with a particular Component or Interaction.</rdfs:comment>
