    <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Controlled vocabulary for the roles that an RNA Component can play in a design. The value of a Component's role property must be an instance of a class that is a subclass of RNARole.</rdfs:comment>
    <otol:constantList rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">true</otol:constantList>
  </rdf:Description>
