    <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Controlled vocabulary for the types of encoding that can be used to represent the primary structure of a Component. The value of a Sequence's encoding property must be an instance of a class that is a subclass of Encoding.</rdfs:comment>
