    <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents a DNA component, with the type of SBO:DNA, the role of DNARole. It restricts instances to have the sequences with the correct DNA encoding.</rdfs:comment>
