    <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Provides a vocabulary to choose the role of a Participation in an Interaction. Participation roles are typically identified using IRIs, such as terms from the Systems Biology Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
