    <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents a chemical structure using the Simplified Molecular-Input Line-Entry System (SMILES) format, with the encoding of EDAM format 1196. The elements property MUST contain a valid SMILES string.</rdfs:comment>
