    <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This property can be used in a Component or Location. A Component MAY have any number of hasSequence properties, each of type IRI, that MUST reference a Sequence object. In a Location, the hasSequence property is REQUIRED and MUST contain the IRI of a Sequence object.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
